WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.200
An overshot wheel: the water arrives at the top.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.400
Follow one bucketful high in the chute.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.000
High water and Earth have a gravitational store.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.400
It pours into a bucket at the top of the wheel.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.200
Its weight pulls that side down, helping the wheel turn.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.000
Energy transfers to the turning wheel: a kinetic store.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.000
The axle turns the millstone, and it grinds the grain.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.500
Grinding and rubbing warm the stones, the flour and the air.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Moving energy spreads into thermal stores.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.800
The tracked energy was not destroyed. It spread out.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.400
Spread-out warmth is hard to use again.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.000
Sunlight drives evaporation. Rain feeds high streams.
